odels this year but the  Alliance of Automobile Manufacturers  says the proposed mandate would miss the  car buyers who need it most  because so few parents of young children  buy new cars the Harrisons hope the law  goes through we need to stop families  having to deal with what I've done to  our family this law can do that senator  Blumenthal a Democrat believes any added  cost for the standard feature would be  minimal  he says the measure should attract  strong bipartisan support and hopes to  see it in new cars as soon as 2019 it is  a heartbreaking story and that took a  lot of bravery for that father to talk  to you like he did I don't know how you  would you would live with that it really  is just one of those awful awful things  he seems to be facing his own  accountability face-on is really good  reporting appreciate it
 

